        <div class="hero__lead">
          <p class="hero__lead-lg">
            A private water supply gives your property genuine independence. Reliable, high-quality
            water from your own source, free of rising utility charges, unaffected by mains
            failures, and treated to a standard mains water rarely matches.
          </p>
          <p class="hero__lead-sm">
            The catch: every source is different, and doing it properly is not a job for generalists.
            We only work on bespoke systems, designed around your specific source water, installed to
            run quietly and reliably, and personally maintained for as long as you need us.
          </p>
        </div>
